{
  "coldCodeAccessCostAcrossUpgrades": {
    "_info": {
      "comment": "The two opcodes EIP-2929 reprices that NO other fixture in this suite executes at all. EXTCODECOPY and CALLCODE appear in no other body here, so before this file their cold and warm prices could be arbitrarily wrong and no post-state root would move. Each is measured TWICE against the same address -- once cold, once warm -- because the pair is the discriminator: a build with no cold/warm distinction returns the same number for both.",
      "eip": "EIP-2929 at Magneto. EIP-150 also reprices both at Gas Reprice, so the body pins two repricings apiece.",
      "slots": "0x10 EXTCODECOPY cold, 0x11 EXTCODECOPY warm, 0x12 CALLCODE cold, 0x13 CALLCODE warm, 0x1f liveness marker.",
      "whyPairsAndNotSinglePoints": "A single cold reading pins a number and nothing about the RULE. Read alongside its warm partner it pins the distinction EIP-2929 introduced -- and a build that never warms an address, or never charges the cold surcharge, collapses the pair to one value. That is what the wrong-build score below actually detects.",
      "addressesTouched": "0x3000 carries code for EXTCODECOPY to read. 0x4000 carries a single STOP so a CALLCODE into it returns immediately and the reading is the access cost rather than the callee's work. Both are cold at first touch and warm at second.",
      "provenance": "Authored 2026-08-25 after a wrong-build matrix found that a client which never charges EXTCODECOPY's cold surcharge, and one which leaves CALLCODE at its pre-2929 gas function, were each passed silently by all 36 state fixtures then in the suite.",
      "oracle": "core-geth's own statetest runner, which is not the implementation under certification.",
      "oracle-version": "core-geth modernized 1.13.0-26975d6a. Production v1.12.21 cannot be used: its t8n fork table has no ETC_DieHard, ETC_Gotham or ETC_DefuseDifficultyBomb.",
      "generated": "2026-08-25",
      "signing": "txbytes carries the signed transaction. Legacy signature through Gas Reprice, replay-protected from Die Hard.",
      "unfilled-no-fork-name": "No expectation for ETC_Thanos: the generator's fork table has no name for it.",
      "unfilled-not-a-state-rule": "No expectation for ETC_DAOFork, ETC_DAOWars, ETC_FrontierThawing, ETC_MESSOff, ETC_MESSOn."
    },
